Chiqish yozish: 1.23, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['1.23'] matn), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['1,23'] son matn son), yangi-qator. # 1,23 no longer valid
Chiqish yozish: (['1,23'] son matn son matn), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['1.23'] son, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['1.23'] raw number, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['1.23'] raw number matn, yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['1.23'] raw number matn son, yangi-qator.
>> x := (3.5 × 1000000 + 1.5).
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
>> x := (3.5 × 100000 + 0.0001 ).
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
>> x := (3.5 + 1000).
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
x := x matn.
Chiqish yozish: x, yangi-qator.
>> y := x son.
Chiqish yozish: y, yangi-qator.